# 根層只放跨子專案的通用規則；各子專案自己的產物放在自己的 .gitignore：
# - 前端（node_modules / dist / 測試輸出…）在 frontend/.gitignore
# - 後端（.venv / __pycache__ / 工具快取…）在 backend/.gitignore

# Environment variables (keep example files)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.sw?

# Task-process docs (specs, plans, reviews, snapshots) stay local.
# Only shared development docs (e.g. docs/reference/) are tracked.
docs/work/
docs/archive/
docs/paused/
docs/snapshots/
docs/retros/
docs/incidents/

# Agent worktrees / local agent state
.claude/

# Playwright MCP 的本機暫存
.playwright-mcp/
